    "type": "game",
    "name": "Soul Chained",
    "steam_appid": 3544130,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add Soul Chained to your wishlist now to support the development of this unique game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/4105d597282cbaf6c474a9cc62364225.avif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend for 8 to 10 hours of intense co-op gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bound together in the depths of Purgatory, two fallen warlords must put their feud on hold to face the monstrous forms of their sins. Survive brutal challenges as one and earn your shot at redemption - or be damned together.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/ef795dcaf898be4a79b0ee3791bd3a37.avif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The chain isn\u2019t just a punishment. For skilled warriors? It can be the most dependable tool. For you? You can always just drag your teammate in the direction you want to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it to interact with both the world and each other in creative and tactical ways:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trip bosses\u00a0mid-attack.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/fecce1b8ce05a4031645b26986d44339.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/fecce1b8ce05a4031645b26986d44339.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/fecce1b8ce05a4031645b26986d44339.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Entrap enemies</strong> in a tight coil.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/239b406a0353ad3a8abc10f1557723d9.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/239b406a0353ad3a8abc10f1557723d9.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/239b406a0353ad3a8abc10f1557723d9.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clothesline entire mobs</strong>\u00a0by pulling the chain tight and charging in unison.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/98a89e13e12f11a5cbc418c820410113.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/98a89e13e12f11a5cbc418c820410113.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/98a89e13e12f11a5cbc418c820410113.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Yank</strong> your partner to safety... or doom (usually doom).</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/fe565591455360896b9eaf667a408c79.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/fe565591455360896b9eaf667a408c79.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/fe565591455360896b9eaf667a408c79.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you master the chain and turn it into a deadly extension of your will - or is it just another opportunity to mess with your rival?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be warned\u2026 Miscommunication will be your final downfall. If you\u2019re not in sync, you\u2019re dead weight...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/f69fabafce511fd465a0c5018a242f6f.avif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every swing counts. Every dodge matters. Combat is deliberate and unforgiving for the weak...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positioning, timing, and teamwork are everything. You\u2019ll need to read enemy patterns and use the chain to your advantage - or remain trapped in purgatory. \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/1485ac90191c78500f5fa35a94b30b11.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/1485ac90191c78500f5fa35a94b30b11.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/1485ac90191c78500f5fa35a94b30b11.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls combat not for you? You could always stand back and watch your teammate try\u2026 and fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/123105fe6f30bf524c499616456e0616.avif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six brutal trials stand between you and redemption - each one a towering embodiment of your past sins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against relentless, merciless reflections of the evils you wrought in life. Bosses demand total coordination to survive - mistime a move and you\u2019ll both fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/ef89a535b3e62944c414db4eb4a999c1.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/ef89a535b3e62944c414db4eb4a999c1.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/ef89a535b3e62944c414db4eb4a999c1.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only imagine the sins you have committed to be trapped in such a place - cursed to battle through nightmares with nothing but your weapon, your instincts, and a partner who insists they <i>&quot;definitely dodged that.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/0e4e2ea241c30e1fd9f04b5db3ccca4a.avif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascension isn\u2019t given - it\u2019s earned, one\u00a0 jump at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate punishing platforming trials where every leap depends on both players. The chain won\u2019t just test your timing - it\u2019ll test your trust... and maybe you\u2019re not feeling that trustworthy today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mistime a jump, and you both fall\u2026 prepare for the blame. Learn to embrace the chain\u2026 or learn to hate it together. \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/28b5574b8503b8d15bcdd132d73dfa80.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/28b5574b8503b8d15bcdd132d73dfa80.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/28b5574b8503b8d15bcdd132d73dfa80.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way out is up - good luck not yelling about it on the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/e6baa4c434683d05e88ede23b5646a5c.avif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where size truly matters - and you\u2019re not on the larger end. Soul Chained drops you into a realm of awe-inspiring scale, where ancient ruins stretch beyond sight and cliffs vanish into the clouds. At the center of it all looms the Colossal Tower - an impossible spire that disappears into the stratosphere\u2026 daring you to brave its trials\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Few places capture this feeling of insignificance, a world to remind you of your place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/bd6e007adb136ca31597655bc32adad7.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/bd6e007adb136ca31597655bc32adad7.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/bd6e007adb136ca31597655bc32adad7.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/abf14db0bbafad2f2667bdb3d1ca5f91.avif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival demands more than endurance - it demands adaptability. Will you favor the speed and precision of a Short Sword, the crushing weight of a Great Sword, or the calculated reach of a Polearm? Each weapon brings a distinct rhythm to combat and changes the way you fight - and the way your partner fights beside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the synergy between styles and test your limits, or just swing your sword and hope for the best\u2026 maybe it\u2019ll work eventually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/85f7852a16890f40fb6667f40456e6bc.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=168 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/85f7852a16890f40fb6667f40456e6bc.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/85f7852a16890f40fb6667f40456e6bc.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/0ca68cf05f9cfc63763449cb60a423b9.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=168 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/0ca68cf05f9cfc63763449cb60a423b9.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/0ca68cf05f9cfc63763449cb60a423b9.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/b8d103148574694c7e41dcef208985b5.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=168 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/b8d103148574694c7e41dcef208985b5.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/b8d103148574694c7e41dcef208985b5.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/b490f47c8b73d5f58fb2199f6566a80a.avif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Chained features a streamlined, lightweight RPG system that keeps you in the fight while still giving you the freedom to forge your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your build through stat choices and personal skills - and remember, it\u2019s not just about you. Your partner\u2019s decisions combine with yours, unlocking new tactical possibilities and deeper strategies\u2026. Or new ways to get the last laugh on your mortal rival.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/1f06c0170dea36dfd952a58e13f80420.avif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=160 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Warlords not chaotic enough? It\u2019s your purgatory after all... Havoc Mode throws up to 4 players into the fray to face the madness together - where strategy cracks, chaos erupts. Only true \u2018coordination\u2019 can hold the line.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s face it, all 4 of you won\u2019t make it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/havoc_mode.gif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo is live now!  Wishlist for updates when the full game releases!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I'm Andrew, a solo dev working hard to deliver this unique and ambitious game. This is a full-time endeavor, and I'm committed to delivering maximum quality. Soul Chained is still actively being developed, meaning any feedback you might have will be greatly appreciated and could influence the direction of development! Please try the demo and let me know what you think :) And please, if you like what you see, add it to your wishlist and consider buying it when it releases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add Soul Chained to your wishlist now to support the development of this unique game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/4105d597282cbaf6c474a9cc62364225.avif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend for 8 to 10 hours of intense co-op gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bound together in the depths of Purgatory, two fallen warlords must put their feud on hold to face the monstrous forms of their sins. Survive brutal challenges as one and earn your shot at redemption - or be damned together.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/ef795dcaf898be4a79b0ee3791bd3a37.avif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The chain isn\u2019t just a punishment. For skilled warriors? It can be the most dependable tool. For you? You can always just drag your teammate in the direction you want to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it to interact with both the world and each other in creative and tactical ways:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trip bosses\u00a0mid-attack.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/fecce1b8ce05a4031645b26986d44339.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/fecce1b8ce05a4031645b26986d44339.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/fecce1b8ce05a4031645b26986d44339.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Entrap enemies</strong> in a tight coil.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/239b406a0353ad3a8abc10f1557723d9.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/239b406a0353ad3a8abc10f1557723d9.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/239b406a0353ad3a8abc10f1557723d9.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clothesline entire mobs</strong>\u00a0by pulling the chain tight and charging in unison.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/98a89e13e12f11a5cbc418c820410113.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/98a89e13e12f11a5cbc418c820410113.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/98a89e13e12f11a5cbc418c820410113.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Yank</strong> your partner to safety... or doom (usually doom).</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/fe565591455360896b9eaf667a408c79.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/fe565591455360896b9eaf667a408c79.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/fe565591455360896b9eaf667a408c79.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you master the chain and turn it into a deadly extension of your will - or is it just another opportunity to mess with your rival?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be warned\u2026 Miscommunication will be your final downfall. If you\u2019re not in sync, you\u2019re dead weight...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/f69fabafce511fd465a0c5018a242f6f.avif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every swing counts. Every dodge matters. Combat is deliberate and unforgiving for the weak...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positioning, timing, and teamwork are everything. You\u2019ll need to read enemy patterns and use the chain to your advantage - or remain trapped in purgatory. \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/1485ac90191c78500f5fa35a94b30b11.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/1485ac90191c78500f5fa35a94b30b11.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/1485ac90191c78500f5fa35a94b30b11.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls combat not for you? You could always stand back and watch your teammate try\u2026 and fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/123105fe6f30bf524c499616456e0616.avif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six brutal trials stand between you and redemption - each one a towering embodiment of your past sins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against relentless, merciless reflections of the evils you wrought in life. Bosses demand total coordination to survive - mistime a move and you\u2019ll both fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/ef89a535b3e62944c414db4eb4a999c1.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/ef89a535b3e62944c414db4eb4a999c1.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/ef89a535b3e62944c414db4eb4a999c1.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only imagine the sins you have committed to be trapped in such a place - cursed to battle through nightmares with nothing but your weapon, your instincts, and a partner who insists they <i>&quot;definitely dodged that.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/0e4e2ea241c30e1fd9f04b5db3ccca4a.avif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascension isn\u2019t given - it\u2019s earned, one\u00a0 jump at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate punishing platforming trials where every leap depends on both players. The chain won\u2019t just test your timing - it\u2019ll test your trust... and maybe you\u2019re not feeling that trustworthy today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mistime a jump, and you both fall\u2026 prepare for the blame. Learn to embrace the chain\u2026 or learn to hate it together. \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/28b5574b8503b8d15bcdd132d73dfa80.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/28b5574b8503b8d15bcdd132d73dfa80.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/28b5574b8503b8d15bcdd132d73dfa80.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way out is up - good luck not yelling about it on the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/e6baa4c434683d05e88ede23b5646a5c.avif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where size truly matters - and you\u2019re not on the larger end. Soul Chained drops you into a realm of awe-inspiring scale, where ancient ruins stretch beyond sight and cliffs vanish into the clouds. At the center of it all looms the Colossal Tower - an impossible spire that disappears into the stratosphere\u2026 daring you to brave its trials\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Few places capture this feeling of insignificance, a world to remind you of your place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/bd6e007adb136ca31597655bc32adad7.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/bd6e007adb136ca31597655bc32adad7.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/bd6e007adb136ca31597655bc32adad7.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/abf14db0bbafad2f2667bdb3d1ca5f91.avif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival demands more than endurance - it demands adaptability. Will you favor the speed and precision of a Short Sword, the crushing weight of a Great Sword, or the calculated reach of a Polearm? Each weapon brings a distinct rhythm to combat and changes the way you fight - and the way your partner fights beside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the synergy between styles and test your limits, or just swing your sword and hope for the best\u2026 maybe it\u2019ll work eventually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/85f7852a16890f40fb6667f40456e6bc.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=168 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/85f7852a16890f40fb6667f40456e6bc.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/85f7852a16890f40fb6667f40456e6bc.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/0ca68cf05f9cfc63763449cb60a423b9.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=168 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/0ca68cf05f9cfc63763449cb60a423b9.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/0ca68cf05f9cfc63763449cb60a423b9.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/b8d103148574694c7e41dcef208985b5.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=168 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/b8d103148574694c7e41dcef208985b5.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/b8d103148574694c7e41dcef208985b5.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/b490f47c8b73d5f58fb2199f6566a80a.avif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Chained features a streamlined, lightweight RPG system that keeps you in the fight while still giving you the freedom to forge your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your build through stat choices and personal skills - and remember, it\u2019s not just about you. Your partner\u2019s decisions combine with yours, unlocking new tactical possibilities and deeper strategies\u2026. Or new ways to get the last laugh on your mortal rival.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/1f06c0170dea36dfd952a58e13f80420.avif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=160 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Warlords not chaotic enough? It\u2019s your purgatory after all... Havoc Mode throws up to 4 players into the fray to face the madness together - where strategy cracks, chaos erupts. Only true \u2018coordination\u2019 can hold the line.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s face it, all 4 of you won\u2019t make it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/havoc_mode.gif?t=1754412394\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo is live now!  Wishlist for updates when the full game releases!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I'm Andrew, a solo dev working hard to deliver this unique and ambitious game. This is a full-time endeavor, and I'm committed to delivering maximum quality. Soul Chained is still actively being developed, meaning any feedback you might have will be greatly appreciated and could influence the direction of development! Please try the demo and let me know what you think :) And please, if you like what you see, add it to your wishlist and consider buying it when it releases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1754412394\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1754412394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A co-op souls-lite adventure awaits in Soul Chained. Face brutal enemies, overcome complex platforming challenges, and learn to work together within the constraints of the Soul Chain. You will be chained to your co-op partner so remember to communicate!",
